    "Adobe InDesign Plug-in",
    "2.8",
    "Plugin file used by Adobe InDesign, a professional page layout application; adds new features to the program, such as UI components, file format support, and page layout options; can be written by third-party developers. Many INDESIGNPLUGIN files are located in the /​Plug-ins/​ directory of the Adobe InDesign installation. Windows Adobe InDesign 2023. Adobe InCopy 2023. Mac Adobe InDesign 2023. Adobe InCopy 2023.",
