    "2.7",
    "Photoshop plug-in developed by Flaming Pear Software; used for transforming images into different shapes and applying various lens effects; must reside in the Plug-ins folder within the Photoshop application folder to work. Windows Adobe Photoshop 2023. Corel PaintShop Pro 2023. Mac Adobe Photoshop 2023.",
    "Windows Adobe Photoshop 2023. Corel PaintShop Pro 2023. Mac Adobe Photoshop 2023.",
