    "2.6",
    "Plugin file used by Coda web development software; contains a plugin that adds new features to the software, such as support for additional languages, website backups, or source code validation. You can double-click a CODAPLUGIN file to install it. The plugin will be saved to ~/​Library/​Application Support/​Coda 2/​Plug-ins/​. Mac Panic Coda 2.",
