    "2.5",
    "Plugin used by Apple Xcode, an IDE used for developing iOS and OS X applications; stores resources that provide capabilities to Xcode; examples include application interface elements, iCloud functions, and a PDF viewer. To install IDEPLUGIN files, place them in the ~/​Library/​Developer/​Xcode/​Plug-Ins directory. Restart Xcode and the plugin will be available. Mac Apple XcodeFree.",
