    "2.0",
    "GIS file created by ArcGIS mapping and spatial analysis software; saves an attribute index for a shapefile (.SHP) or a corresponding.DBF file. NOTE: ArcGIS 8 and later use a different attribute index format than ArcView 3.x. Windows ESRI ArcGIS Pro. Plugin for Animation:Master, an easy-to-use 3D animation program; adds additional functionality, such as graphic and animation effects, to the application. NOTE: The file RANDEX.ATX is a known worm file and should not be opened. Instead it should be deleted or removed with an antivirus program. Windows Hash Animation:Master Mac Hash Animation:Master.",
