    "Render Plug-in",
    "1.8",
    "Plug-in used by game system emulators; contains features that extend and enhance gameplay, such as a Magnification Filter that increases clarity of images and video seen during gameplay. Commonly used by Kega Fusion, a cross-platform emulator for various game systems. Some of the consoles include: Sega SG1000, Game Gear, Genesis/Megadrive, and System Master. Windows Kega Fusion. Mac Kega Fusion. Linux Kega FusionFree.",
